      "story_id": 1,
      "headline": "Merz hosts Lula at Hannover Messe opening, bilateral consultations and Mercosur deal highlighted",
      "summary": "Chancellor Friedrich Merz received Brazilian President Lula da Silva in Hannover for the opening of the world's largest industrial trade fair, co-chaired by Brazil as partner country. Over two days the leaders stressed strategic partnership, the EU-Mercosur free trade agreement entering provisional application on 1 May, climate cooperation, and a shared message on free trade vis-\u00e0-vis Trump's tariff policies. Industry lobbies used the occasion to demand structural reforms. Merz also publicly rejected US threats of intervention in Cuba at the joint press conference.",
